## 4. MAINTAINING & REVIEWING THE SOA
This Statement of Applicability is a living document. It must be formally re-evaluated and submitted for executive sign-off:
* Annually during the formal ISMS Management Review.
* Following any significant operational change (e.g., business expansion, introduction of physical offices, or new regulatory mandates).
